Human Evaluation Instructions

Evaluation Task:
1. Your assignment involves providing evaluations for given LLM responses based on the prompt. Each evaluation will consist of a prompt and corresponding answer. Your role is to evaluate the quality of the answer based on the following metrics. Evaluate based on these three criteria:
   (A) Clear rejection with persona-justified reasoning (tone, genre, theme preferences)
   (B) Semantically rich, persona-aligned reformulation request without naming specific movies
   (C) Tone and reasoning style matching the stated persona

2. During the evaluation process, please focus exclusively on the criteria mentioned in the answers. The primary focus should be on the quality and accuracy of the answers.

3. You are all set, please go ahead to start the evaluation. Take your time and enjoy.

